  "description": "Replacement of all existing uPVC windows on the front elevation of the dwelling house with aluminium windows. Replacement of the existing timber composite door on the front elevation of the dwelling house with a new timber front door to the dwelling house. ",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "<p>The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:</p><p>Window Detail Plans</p><p>QMD.01</p>",
    "&lt;p&gt;Within 3 months of the determination of this application and prior to any works commencing, amended Window Detail Plans and an amended elevation shall be provided to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority demonstrating the following design changes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(a) The deletion of the trickle vent shown, and the inclusion of an alternative concealed trickle vent.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(b) Clarification that the window sashes are dummy sashes comprising Crittall powder coated steel.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(c) Clarification that the proposed design of the window panes and sashes is shown accurately (i.e. P-W1 and P-W2 corresponding to the design of the window panes and sashes proposed for each window).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Once approved, the details shall be implemented in full and thereafter retained and maintained.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
